The source code of Simply Anime is published so it can be read, reviewed and built.
It is source available, not open source.

You may:
- read and study the source
- build it and use the mod in singleplayer, on servers and in videos
- include it in modpacks, as long as the pack downloads it from its official
  CurseForge or Modrinth page
- fork this repository to send changes back as pull requests

